{"lesson_uid":"L0161","_provenance":{"generator":"backend/scripts/generate_lesson_zhuyin.py","reading_authority":"frontend/src/components/zhuyin/polyphonicProcessor.ts（跑，非移植）","source_font":"frontend/public/fonts/BpmfZihiSerif-Regular.ttf","font_sha256_16":"fc25a90d27699ec4","poyin_db_sha256_16":"2d4d4c9f1d0ec1a6","notation":"pypinyin BopomofoConverter（與 font_readings.json 同一個轉換器）","stats":{"texts":297,"chars":6859,"poly_positions":1763,"he_adjudicated":2,"xiang_adjudicated":0,"manual_corrections":0}},"texts":[{"section":"classical_text","slug":"xahdd","idx":null,"text":"楚人.江乙.為郢大夫。有入王宮中.盜者，令尹.以罪乙，請於王.而黜之。","n":35,"ssz":"........1.........................."},{"section":"classical_text","slug":"xahdd","idx":null,"text":"其母.往言.於王曰：「妾.夜亡布.八匹，令尹.盜之。」王謂母曰：「令尹.信盜之，寡人.不為其富貴.而不行法焉。若不盜.而誣之，楚國.有常法。」","n":71,"ssz":"........................................................1.............."},{"section":"classical_text","slug":"xahdd","idx":null,"text":"母曰：「令尹.不身盜之也，乃使人.盜之。」王曰：「其使人盜.奈何？」對曰：「昔.孫叔敖.之為令尹也，道.不拾遺，門.不閉關，而盜賊.自息。今.令尹.之治也，耳目.不明，盜賊.公行，是故.使盜.得盜.妾之布，是與.使人盜.何以異也？」","n":116,"ssz":"..........................................................1.....................................1..................."},{"section":"classical_text","slug":"xahdd","idx":null,"text":"王曰：「令尹.在上，寇盜.在下，令尹.不知.有何罪焉？」母曰：「昔日.妾之子.為郢大夫，有盜王宮中.之物者，妾子.坐¹而黜，妾子.亦豈知之哉？然.終坐之。令尹.獨何人，而不以是.為過也²？昔者.周武王.有言曰：『百姓.有過，在予.一人。』上不明.則下不治，相不賢.則國不寧。王其.察之。」","n":144,"ssz":".....................................1...1.............1.......1...................................................2.........1.................."},{"section":"modern_translation","slug":"3h7ad","idx":null,"text":"楚國人江乙擔任郢都的大夫。有人進入王宮偷盜，令尹因此怪罪江乙，向楚王請求罷黜(免職)他。","n":44,"ssz":"..........1................................."},{"section":"modern_translation","slug":"3h7ad","idx":null,"text":"江乙的母親到王宮拜見楚王說：「我在半夜丟失八匹布，是令尹偷了我的布。」楚王告訴江乙的母親說：「令尹確實偷布的話，我不會因為他富貴而不依法處置。但如果令尹沒有偷竊卻誣賴他，楚國是有法律的。」","n":94,"ssz":".........................................................1..1................................."},{"section":"modern_translation","slug":"3h7ad","idx":null,"text":"江母說：「即使令尹不是親自去偷，也是指使人偷的。」楚王說：「他如何指使人偷盜？」江母回答：「從前孫叔敖擔任令尹時，路上不會有人撿走失物，家裡的門不用關，而盜賊自動就消失了。如今他令尹治理，耳朵和眼睛不清楚(能力差、愚昧糊塗)，盜賊公然橫行，所以才使盜賊得以偷走我的布，這跟指使人偷有什麼不同？」","n":147,"ssz":".........1.................................................1............1......................11.................................................."},{"section":"modern_translation","slug":"3h7ad","idx":null,"text":"楚王說：「令尹在朝廷，盜賊在民間，令尹有什麼罪過呢？」江乙的母親說：「從前我的孩子作為郢都的官員，有人偷了王宮的東西，我的孩子卻受到連坐而被免職，我的孩子又哪裡知道(盜賊要到王宮偷東西)呢？但他最終受到連坐而被罰。令尹是什麼特別的人，卻不因為這樣算他的錯嗎？從前周武王說過：『百姓有罪過，原因都在我一人。』上面的官員不賢明，那麼下面的人民就不能治理好，宰相不賢能，那麼國家就不安寧。請王上明察這件事。」","n":201,"ssz":"........................................1.....................1.............1...........................................1............................2..................................................."},{"section":"served:lesson_code","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"文-L6","n":4,"ssz":"...."},{"section":"served:series","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"文言文","n":3,"ssz":"..."},{"section":"served:title","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"江乙媽媽告御狀","n":7,"ssz":"...1..."},{"section":"served:reading_strategy","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"文言文閱讀策略──指示與疑問代詞","n":16,"ssz":"................"},{"section":"served:reading_strategy_explained","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"我們要練習的是，弄清楚文言文裡面的「指示代詞」（像「這」、「那」）和「疑問代詞」（像「什麼」、「為什麼」）指的到底是什麼，這樣才能更精準地理解故事；\n這篇文章裡，江乙媽媽就是很巧妙地運用了「此」跟「彼」來對比，點出問題在哪裡，這剛好可以讓我們練習分辨這些詞在課文裡實際指涉的對象；\n讀的時候，不妨停下來問問自己，這些「這」、「那」、「什麼」指的究竟是哪個人、哪件事，幫助你抓住作者想表達的重點","n":196,"ssz":".................................1..............1...................................1.....1.....................................................................................1..................."},{"section":"served:reading_strategy_explained#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"我們要練習的是，弄清楚文言文裡面的「指示代詞」（像「這」、「那」）和「疑問代詞」（像「什麼」、「為什麼」）指的到底是什麼，這樣才能更精準地理解故事；","n":74,"ssz":".................................1..............1........................."},{"section":"served:reading_strategy_explained#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"這篇文章裡，江乙媽媽就是很巧妙地運用了「此」跟「彼」來對比，點出問題在哪裡，這剛好可以讓我們練習分辨這些詞在課文裡實際指涉的對象；","n":65,"ssz":".........1.....1................................................."},{"section":"served:reading_strategy_explained#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"讀的時候，不妨停下來問問自己，這些「這」、「那」、「什麼」指的究竟是哪個人、哪件事，幫助你抓住作者想表達的重點","n":55,"ssz":"...................................1..................."},{"section":"served:intro.background","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"這篇文章講述了江乙的母親為了替兒子洗刷冤屈，勇敢地向楚王上訴的故事。當時江乙因為宮中失竊而被牽連，母親為了證明兒子的清白，巧妙地運用了比喻和歷史典故，向楚王說明了身為上位者應有的責任。她透過對比過去清明的政治，以及現今令尹的失職，來點出問題的癥結所在。這篇文章讓我們看到一位母親的智慧與勇氣，以及她對公平正義的堅持。","n":158,"ssz":"............1...1.......1..............1...........1....1......1.....1.................................................................1......................"},{"section":"served:manifest_sections[0].name","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"導讀","n":2,"ssz":".."},{"section":"served:manifest_sections[1].name","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"古文今譯","n":4,"ssz":"...."},{"section":"served:manifest_sections[2].name","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"原文（含斷詞點）＋注釋","n":11,"ssz":"..........."},{"section":"served:manifest_sections[3].name","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"朗讀計時","n":4,"ssz":"...."},{"section":"served:manifest_sections[4].no","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"一","n":1,"ssz":"."},{"section":"served:manifest_sections[4].name","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"文白句子比對","n":6,"ssz":"...1.."},{"section":"served:manifest_sections[5].no","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"二","n":1,"ssz":"."},{"section":"served:manifest_sections[5].name","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"文白詞語比對","n":6,"ssz":"......"},{"section":"served:manifest_sections[6].no","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"三","n":1,"ssz":"."},{"section":"served:manifest_sections[6].name","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"文章重點表","n":5,"ssz":"....."},{"section":"served:manifest_sections[7].no","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"四","n":1,"ssz":"."},{"section":"served:manifest_sections[7].name","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"文言文聚光燈","n":6,"ssz":"......"},{"section":"served:manifest_sections[7].subtitle","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"指示代詞、疑問代詞","n":9,"ssz":"........."},{"section":"served:manifest_sections[8].no","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"五","n":1,"ssz":"."},{"section":"served:manifest_sections[8].name","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"閱讀理解","n":4,"ssz":"...."},{"section":"served:manifest_sections[9].no","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"六","n":1,"ssz":"."},{"section":"served:manifest_sections[9].name","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"自我挑戰","n":4,"ssz":"...."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[0].question","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"下列選項「」文字中讀音與字義，何者錯誤？","n":20,"ssz":"...................."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[0].options[0]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"若不盜而「誣」之──ㄨ，誣賴","n":14,"ssz":".1............"},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[0].options[1]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"請於王而「黜」之──ㄔㄨˋ，免職","n":16,"ssz":"................"},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[0].options[2]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"「寇」盜在下──ㄎㄡˋ，土匪","n":14,"ssz":".............."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[0].options[3]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"百姓有過，在「予」一人──ㄩˊ，給。","n":18,"ssz":".........2........"},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[1].question","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"下列哪一個成語的解釋錯誤？","n":13,"ssz":"....1........"},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[1].options[0]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"顧此失彼──注意這個卻忽略了那個","n":16,"ssz":".........1.....1"},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[1].options[1]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"若無其事──好像沒有那麼一回事","n":15,"ssz":"..............."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[1].options[2]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"心不在焉──心思不在這裡","n":12,"ssz":".1......1..."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[1].options[3]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"愛莫能助──最無私的愛就是能助人","n":16,"ssz":"................"},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[2].question","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"下列哪一選項中的「之」，代指的是江乙媽媽被偷的布？","n":25,"ssz":"...2...............1....."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[2].options[0]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"令尹以罪乙，請於王而黜「之」","n":14,"ssz":".............."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[2].options[1]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"妾夜亡布八匹，令尹盜「之」","n":13,"ssz":"............."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[2].options[2]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"有盜王宮中「之」物者，妾子坐而黜","n":16,"ssz":"............1..."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[2].options[3]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"盜賊公行，是故使盜得盜妾「之」布。","n":17,"ssz":".........1......."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[3].question","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"根據本文，下列文句「」中的字義，何者說明最恰當？","n":24,"ssz":"........................"},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[3].options[0]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"妾夜「亡」布八匹：損壞","n":11,"ssz":"..........."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[3].options[1]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"令尹「信」盜之：隨意","n":10,"ssz":".........."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[3].options[2]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"妾子「坐」而黜：受罰","n":10,"ssz":".1........"},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[3].options[3]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"王「其」察之：難道","n":9,"ssz":"........."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[4].question","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"根據本文，下列關於令尹與楚王的敘述何者最恰當？","n":23,"ssz":"......................."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[4].options[0]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"令尹打算偷盜布匹再將罪責嫁禍給他人","n":17,"ssz":".......1........."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[4].options[1]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"令尹主張楚國盜賊橫行是須正視的問題","n":17,"ssz":"................."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[4].options[2]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"楚王覺得宮中之物被盜應是令尹的責任","n":17,"ssz":"...1............."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[4].options[3]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"楚王認為不論身分地位都應該遵守法律","n":17,"ssz":"....1..1........."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[5].question","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"根據本文，江母見楚王的目的最可能是下列何者？","n":22,"ssz":".......