布","n":3,"ssz":"..."},{"section":"served:word_matching.items[2].文言","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"王謂母曰：「令尹信盜之，寡人不為其富貴而不行法焉。若不盜而誣之，楚國有常法。」","n":39,"ssz":"..........................1............"},{"section":"served:word_matching.items[2].白話","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"楚王告訴江乙的母親說：「令尹（　）偷（　）的話，（　）不會因為他富貴而不依法處置。但（　）令尹沒有偷竊卻（　），楚國是有法律的。」","n":65,"ssz":"...........................1..1.................................."},{"section":"served:word_matching.items[2].blanks[0].answer","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"確實","n":2,"ssz":".."},{"section":"served:word_matching.items[2].blanks[1].answer","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"布","n":1,"ssz":"."},{"section":"served:word_matching.items[2].blanks[3].answer","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"如果","n":2,"ssz":".."},{"section":"served:word_matching.items[2].blanks[4].answer","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"誣賴他","n":3,"ssz":"..."},{"section":"served:word_matching.items[3].文言","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"昔孫叔敖之為令尹也，道不拾遺，門不閉關，而盜賊自息。","n":26,"ssz":"................1........."},{"section":"served:word_matching.items[3].白話","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"（　）孫叔敖（　）令尹時，路上不會有人（　），家裡的門不用關，而盜賊自動就消失了。","n":41,"ssz":"...............1...........1............."},{"section":"served:word_matching.items[3].blanks[0].answer","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"從前","n":2,"ssz":".."},{"section":"served:word_matching.items[3].blanks[1].answer","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"擔任","n":2,"ssz":".."},{"section":"served:word_matching.items[3].blanks[2].answer","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"撿走失物","n":4,"ssz":"...."},{"section":"served:word_matching.items[4].文言","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"今令尹之治也，耳目不明，盜賊公行，是故使盜得盜妾之布，是與使人盜何以異也？","n":37,"ssz":".....................1..............."},{"section":"served:word_matching.items[4].白話","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"如今他令尹治理，耳朵和眼睛不清楚，盜賊（　），（　）才使盜賊得以偷走（　），（　）跟指使人偷（　）不同？","n":52,"ssz":".........11........................................."},{"section":"served:word_matching.items[4].blanks[0].answer","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"公然橫行","n":4,"ssz":"...."},{"section":"served:word_matching.items[4].blanks[1].answer","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"所以","n":2,"ssz":".."},{"section":"served:word_matching.items[4].blanks[3].answer","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"這","n":1,"ssz":"."},{"section":"served:word_matching.items[4].blanks[4].answer","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"有什麼","n":3,"ssz":"..."},{"section":"served:word_matching.items[5].文言","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"相不賢則國不寧。王其察之。","n":13,"ssz":"............."},{"section":"served:word_matching.items[5].白話","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"宰相不（　），那麼國家就不（　）。請王上明察（　）。","n":26,"ssz":".........................."},{"section":"served:word_matching.items[5].blanks[0].answer","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"賢能","n":2,"ssz":".."},{"section":"served:word_matching.items[5].blanks[1].answer","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"安寧","n":2,"ssz":".."},{"section":"served:word_matching.items[5].blanks[2].answer","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"這件事","n":3,"ssz":"..."},{"section":"served:sentence_matching.label","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"一、文白句子比對","n":8,"ssz":".....1.."},{"section":"served:sentence_matching.instruction","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"請模仿例句作法：\n❶ 閱讀原文；❷ 找出對應的參考句；❸ 在下方的[  ]寫上參考句代號","n":44,"ssz":".....................1......................"},{"section":"served:sentence_matching.instruction#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"請模仿例句作法：","n":8,"ssz":"........"},{"section":"served:sentence_matching.instruction#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"❶ 閱讀原文；❷ 找出對應的參考句；❸ 在下方的[  ]寫上參考句代號","n":35,"ssz":"............1......................"},{"section":"served:sentence_matching.example.文言","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"楚人江乙為郢大夫","n":8,"ssz":"......1."},{"section":"served:sentence_matching.reference_sentences.1","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"路上不會有人撿走失物，家裡的門不用關，而盜賊自動就消失了","n":28,"ssz":"..1............1............"},{"section":"served:sentence_matching.reference_sentences.2","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"如今他令尹治理，耳朵和眼睛不清楚，盜賊公然橫行","n":23,"ssz":".........11............"},{"section":"served:sentence_matching.reference_sentences.3","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"但如果令尹沒有偷竊卻誣賴他，楚國是有法律的","n":21,"ssz":"....................."},{"section":"served:sentence_matching.reference_sentences.4","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"上面的官員不賢明，那麼下面的人民就不能治理好","n":22,"ssz":"......................"},{"section":"served:sentence_matching.reference_sentences.5","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"令尹在朝廷，盜賊在民間，令尹有什麼罪過呢","n":20,"ssz":"...................."},{"section":"served:sentence_matching.reference_sentences.6","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"楚國人江乙擔任郢都的大夫","n":12,"ssz":"..........1."},{"section":"served:sentence_matching.reference_sentences.7","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"令尹是什麼特別的人，卻不因為這樣算他的錯嗎","n":21,"ssz":".............1......."},{"section":"served:sentence_matching.reference_sentences.8","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"百姓有罪過，原因都在我一人","n":13,"ssz":"...........2."},{"section":"served:sentence_matching.reference_sentences.9","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"所以才使盜賊得以偷走我的布，這跟指使人偷有什麼不同","n":25,"ssz":"........................."},{"section":"served:sentence_matching.reference_sentences.10","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"有人進入王宮偷盜，令尹因此怪罪江乙，向楚王請求罷黜他","n":26,"ssz":".........................."},{"section":"served:sentence_matching.reference_sentences.11","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"令尹確實偷布的話，我不會因為他富貴而不依法處置","n":23,"ssz":"..........1..1........."},{"section":"served:sentence_matching.reference_sentences.12","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"有人偷了王宮的東西，我的孩子卻受連坐而被免職","n":22,"ssz":".............1........"},{"section":"served:sentence_matching.reference_sentences.13","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"令尹不是親自偷布的，是指使人偷的","n":16,"ssz":"..1............."},{"section":"served:sentence_matching.reference_sentences.14","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"請王上明察這件事","n":8,"ssz":"........"},{"section":"served:sentence_matching.reference_sentences.15","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"我在半夜丟失八匹布，是令尹偷了我的布","n":18,"ssz":".................."},{"section":"served:sentence_matching.items[0].文言","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"有入王宮中盜者，令尹以罪乙，請於王而黜之","n":20,"ssz":"...................."},{"section":"served:sentence_matching.items[1].文言","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"妾夜亡布八匹，令尹盜之","n":11,"ssz":"..........."},{"section":"served:sentence_matching.items[2].文言","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"令尹信盜之，寡人不為其富貴而不行法焉","n":18,"ssz":".................."},{"section":"served:sentence_matching.items[3].文言","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"若不盜而誣之，楚國有常法","n":12,"ssz":".1.........."},{"section":"served:sentence_matching.items[4].文言","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"令尹不身盜之也，乃使人盜之","n":13,"ssz":"............."},{"section":"served:sentence_matching.items[5].文言","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"道不拾遺，門不閉關，而盜賊自息","n":15,"ssz":"......1........"},{"section":"served:sentence_matching.items[6].文言","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"今令尹之治也，耳目不明，盜賊公行","n":16,"ssz":"................"},{"section":"served:sentence_matching.items[7].文言","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"是故使盜得盜妾之布，是與使人盜何以異也","n":19,"ssz":"....1.............."},{"section":"served:sentence_matching.items[8].文言","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"令尹在上，寇盜在下，令尹不知有何罪焉","n":18,"ssz":".................."},{"section":"served:sentence_matching.items[9].文言","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"有盜王宮中之物者，妾子坐而黜","n":14,"ssz":"..........1..."},{"section":"served:sentence_matching.items[11].文言","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"百姓有過，在予一人","n":9,"ssz":".......2."},{"section":"served:sentence_matching.items[12].文言","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"上不明則下不治","n":7,"ssz":".....1."},{"section":"served:sentence_matching.items[13].文言","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"王其察之","n":4,"ssz":"...."},{"section":"served:self_challenge.label","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"六、自我挑戰","n":6,"ssz":"......"},{"section":"served:self_challenge.instruction","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"請閱讀以下文章，完成問題。提醒：記得運用文言文的閱讀策略哦！","n":30,"ssz":".................1............"},{"section":"served:self_challenge.strategy_flow[0]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"❶斷句","n":3,"ssz":"..."},{"section":"served:self_challenge.strategy_flow[1]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"❷找動詞/形容詞","n":8,"ssz":"........"},{"section":"served:self_challenge.strategy_flow[2]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"❸找/補主語","n":6,"ssz":"......"},{"section":"served:self_challenge.strategy_flow[3]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"❹用自己的話說一說","n":9,"ssz":"........."},{"section":"served:self_challenge.passage.classical","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"子胥出逃，邊候¹得之。子胥曰：「上索我者，以我有美珠也。今我已亡之矣，我將謂子取而吞之。」候因釋之。","n":50,"ssz":"1..........1..........................1..........."},{"section":"served:self_challenge.passage.source","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"(107 會考)","n":8,"ssz":"........"},{"section":"served:self_challenge.passage.annotations[0].term","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"邊候","n":2,"ssz":".."},{"section":"served:self_challenge.passage.annotations[0].text","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"邊吏。","n":3,"ssz":"..."},{"section":"served:self_challenge.passage.modern","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"伍子胥要逃離國境，駐守邊境的官吏抓到他。伍子胥說：「國君派人抓我，是因為我有國君想要的美珠。但現在我已經丟失了美珠，(如果您把我送到國君那)，我會說是您把它搶走並私吞了。」駐守邊境的官吏因此釋放了伍子胥。","n":102,"ssz":".1...................1.............1...............................................................1.."},{"section":"served:self_challenge.items.label","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"（一）請依照故事脈絡，回答下列問題。","n":18,"ssz":".................."},{"section":"served:self_challenge.items.questions[0].stem","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"根據斷句後的第一個分句，主語是誰？","n":17,"ssz":"................."},{"section":"served:self_challenge.items.questions[0].answer","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"子胥","n":2,"ssz":"1."},{"section":"served:self_challenge.items.questions[1].stem","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"承上題，這個主語怎麼樣或做什麼？","n":16,"ssz":".....1.........."},{"section":"served:self_challenge.items.questions[1].answer","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"他逃跑/他逃亡了","n":8,"ssz":"........"},{"section":"served:self_challenge.items.questions[2].stem","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"這個分句還有另一個人物，他是誰？","n":16,"ssz":".1......1......."},{"section":"served:self_challenge.items.questions[3].stem","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"承上題，這個人怎麼樣或做什麼？(判斷代詞)","n":21,"ssz":".....1..............."},{"section":"served:self_challenge.items.questions[3].answer","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"他得到/抓到子胥","n":8,"ssz":"......1."},{"section":"served:self_challenge.items.questions[4].stem","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"根據第二個分句，子胥說：「上面的人要抓我」，理由是什麼？","n":28,"ssz":"....1...1..................."},{"section":"served:self_challenge.items.questions[4].answer","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"因為他(子胥)有美珠","n":10,"ssz":".1..1....."},{"section":"served:self_challenge.items.questions[5].stem","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"子胥說：「今我已亡之矣」，意思是「我現在已經把美珠搞丟了」。根據子胥的說法，他把美珠搞丟的原因是什麼？","n":51,"ssz":"1.............2.................1.................."},{"section":"served:self_challenge.items.questions[5].answer","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"子(邊候)取而吞之/被邊候拿走私吞了","n":18,"ssz":".................."},{"section":"served:self_challenge.quiz.label","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"（二）閱讀理解測驗","n":9,"ssz":"........."},{"section":"served:self_challenge.quiz.questions[0].stem","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"根據這段文字，下列敘述何者正確？","n":16,"ssz":"................"},{"section":"served:self_challenge.quiz.questions[0].options.A","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"子胥用言語威脅邊候以求自保","n":13,"ssz":"1............"},{"section":"served:self_challenge.quiz.questions[0].options.B","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"子胥以美珠賄賂邊候換取自由","n":13,"ssz":"1............"},{"section":"served:self_challenge.quiz.questions[0].options.C","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"邊候侵吞子胥的美珠又誣陷他","n":13,"ssz":"....1........"},{"section":"served:self_challenge.quiz.questions[0].options.D","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"邊候相信子胥的清白而釋放他","n":13,"ssz":"..1.1........"},{"section":"served:intro_guide.text","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"這故事發生在二千多年前的楚國。江乙是當時的小官，他管轄的郢都王宮發生竊案，江乙的長官（叫做「令尹」）不高興，就報請楚王把江乙免職了。\n東西又不是江乙偷的，結果他被免職，說起來實在很冤枉。這時，又聰明又勇敢的江乙媽媽挺身而出，就跑到王宮找楚王，為自己的兒子打抱不平了。\n「大王，我家掉了八匹布，是令尹偷的！」她告狀道。\n「講話小心一點，你若誣告，國家是有法律的喔！」楚王警告。\n「就算不是令尹偷的，也是他指使人去偷的！」江乙媽媽答，而且說了一長段的話，意思是令尹沒有把國家治理好，才出現這麼多小偷，我家掉了東西，他當然要負責。\n「但小偷偷東西，令尹並不知道啊，這跟他有什麼關係？」王說。\n「對啊，那王宮掉了東西，又跟我兒子有什麼關係？」江乙媽媽說出了心中的話。\n江乙媽媽說了這麼多，你覺得有道理嗎？最後，她有達到目的嗎？答案就隱藏在本課的某一頁中，祝你順利找到答案哦。","n":383,"ssz":"........................................1...........1.................1...................................1..............1....1.....................................2..............1...........1....................1......2......2..................................................................................1..........1............1........1.............2.........................."},{"section":"served:intro_guide.text#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"這故事發生在二千多年前的楚國。江乙是當時的小官，他管轄的郢都王宮發生竊案，江乙的長官（叫做「令尹」）不高興，就報請楚王把江乙免職了。","n":66,"ssz":"........................................1...........1............."},{"section":"served:intro_guide.text#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"東西又不是江乙偷的，結果他被免職，說起來實在很冤枉。這時，又聰明又勇敢的江乙媽媽挺身而出，就跑到王宮找楚王，為自己的兒子打抱不平了。","n":66,"ssz":"...1...................................1..............1....1......"},{"section":"served:intro_guide.text#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"「大王，我家掉了八匹布，是令尹偷的！」她告狀道。","n":24,"ssz":"........................"},{"section":"served:intro_guide.text#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"「講話小心一點，你若誣告，國家是有法律的喔！」楚王警告。","n":28,"ssz":".....2..............1......."},{"section":"served:intro_guide.text#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"「就算不是令尹偷的，也是他指使人去偷的！」江乙媽媽答，而且說了一長段的話，意思是令尹沒有把國家治理好，才出現這麼多小偷，我家掉了東西，他當然要負責。","n":74,"ssz":"...1....................1......2......2..................................."},{"section":"served:intro_guide.text#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"「但小偷偷東西，令尹並不知道啊，這跟他有什麼關係？」王說。","n":29,"ssz":"............................."},{"section":"served:intro_guide.text#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"「對啊，那王宮掉了東西，又跟我兒子有什麼關係？」江乙媽媽說出了心中的話。","n":36,"ssz":"................1..........1........"},{"section":"served:intro_guide.text#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"江乙媽媽說了這麼多，你覺得有道理嗎？最後，她有達到目的嗎？答案就隱藏在本課的某一頁中，祝你順利找到答案哦。","n":53,"ssz":"...1...